   "text": "Falling snow stuck to Tom's fleece all morning.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 2.808
  },
  {
   "text": "Then it melted, and by lunch the fleece was wet and cold.",
   "start": 2.908,
   "end": 6.169
  },
  {
   "text": "The fix: in falling snow, wear a light shell over your fleece so the snow slides off.",
   "start": 6.419,
   "end": 11.181
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this for the next snowy hike.",
   "start": 11.481,
